\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"yang-minghai22\",\n                    \"name\": \"Yang Minghai\",\n                    \"email\": \"yangminghai2@huawei.com\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"yyhxz\",\n                    \"name\": \"Jin Rencao\",\n                    \"email\": \"jinrencao@huawei.com\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"liulili-huawei\",\n                    \"name\": \"Liu Lili\",\n                    \"email\": \"liulili715@huawei.com\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"lvhaoyu1\",\n                    \"name\": \"Lv Haoyu\",\n                    \"email\": \"lvhaoyu@huawei.com\"\n                }]\n            }],\n            \"branches\": [{\n                \"repo_branch\": [{\n                    \"repo\": \"mindspore/vllm-mindspore\",\n                    \"branch\": \"r0.1\"\n                }],\n                \"keeper\": [{\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"panshaowu\"\n                }]\n            }],\n            \"repo_count\": 1,\n            \"repos\": [{\n                \"repo_name\": \"mindspore/vllm-mindspore\"\n            }]\n        }, {\n            \"name\": \"LLM Training System\",\n            \"description\": \"LLM Training System SIG（Special Interest Group）是 MindSpore 开源社区下聚焦于利用分布式并行技术加速AI大模型训练的技术团队，团队致力于提升语言、多模态、全模态等大模型在分布式并行训练场景下的易用性与性能等方面的表现，提供可高效开发、灵活组合多种并行策略的并行编程范式，简化并行编程的复杂度，为开发者带来极简高效的分布式并行训练体验。\",\n            \"description_en\": \"The LLM Training System SIG (Special Interest Group) is a technical team within the MindSpore open-source community focused on accelerating AI large model training using distributed parallel technologies. The team is dedicated to enhancing the usability and performance of large models (such as language, multimodal, and omnidirectional models) in distributed parallel training scenarios. It provides a parallel programming paradigm that enables efficient development and flexible combination of various parallel strategies, simplifies the complexity of parallel programming, and offers developers an extremely simple and efficient distributed parallel training experience.\",\n            \"created_on\": \"2025-10-11\",\n            \"mailing_list\": \"dev@mindspore.cn\",\n            \"mature_level\": \"startup\",\n            \"mentors\": [{\n                \"gitee_id\": \"NA\",\n                \"name\": \"Li Cheng\",\n                \"organization\": \"University of Science and Technology of China\",\n                \"email\": \"chengli7@ustc.edu.cn\"\n            }],\n            \"maintainers\": [{\n                \"gitee_id\": \"stsuteng\",\n                \"name\": \"Su Teng\",\n                \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                \"email\": \"suteng@huawei.com\",\n                \"role\": \"maintainer\"\n            }, {\n                \"gitee_id\": \"yangzhenzhang\",\n                \"name\": \"Yang Zhenzhang\",\n                \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                \"email\": \"yangzhenzhang@huawei.com\",\n                \"role\": \"maintainer\"\n            }, {\n                \"gitee_id\": \"kisnwang\",\n                \"name\": \"Wang Kaisheng\",\n                \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                \"email\": \"wangkaisheng2@huawei.com\",\n                \"role\": \"maintainer\"\n            }, {\n                \"gitee_id\": \"yao_yf\",\n                \"name\": \"Yao Yifan\",\n                \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                \"email\": \"yaoyifan1@huawei.com\",\n                \"role\": \"maintainer\"\n            }],\n            \"repositories\": [{\n                \"repo\": [\"mindspore/mindspore/\"],\n                \"directory\": [\"mindspore/python/mindspore/parallel\"],\n                \"repo-admin\": [{\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"yangzhenzhang\",\n                    \"name\": \"Yang Zhenzhang\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Huawei\",\n                    \"email\": \"yangzhenzhang@huawei.com\"\n                }],\n                \"committers\": [{\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"HulkTang\",\n                    \"name\": \"Tang Huikang\",\n                    \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                    \"email\": \"tanghuikang@huawei.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"liu-yanwei6\",\n                    \"name\": \"Liu Yanwei\",\n                    \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                    \"email\": \"liuyanwei6@huawei.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"bj-wang\",\n                    \"name\": \"Wang Haoran\",\n                    \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                    \"email\": \"wanghaoran19@huawei.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"askmiao\",\n                    \"name\": \"Miao Yanming\",\n                    \"organization\": \"HUAWEI\",\n                    \"email\": \"miaoyanming@huawei.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }]\n            }],\n            \"repo_count\": 1,\n            \"repos\": [{\n                \"repo_name\": \"mindspore/mindspore\"\n            }]\n        }, {\n            \"name\": \"Security & Trusted AI\",\n            \"description\": \"MindSpore Security & Trusted AI SIG包含以下两个职责：第一个是负责接受和响应MindSpore相关的安全问题报告、提供社区安全编码以及规范的指导、进行社区安全编码的评审，制定和决策，开展社区安全治理。第二个是聚焦于人工智能领域的模型、数据可信技术，致力于打造安全可靠的AI计算框架。\",\n            \"description_en\": \"MindSpore Security & Trusted AI SIG has two respondisbilities. First, MindSpore Security receives and responds to MindSpore security issues, provides community security guidance, reviews the safety of code, make decision of the security of the code and carries out security governance. Second, trusted ai focus on models and data trust technology in the field of artificial intelligence, including model robustness and interpretability, privacy computing, model security deployment, and so on. Our goal is to build a secure and trusted AI computing framework.\",\n            \"created_on\": \"2019-12-31\",\n            \"mailing_list\": \"dev@mindspore.cn\",\n            \"maintainers\": [{\n                \"gitee_id\": \"yyuse\",\n                \"name\": \"yangyuan\",\n                \"organization\": \"Huawei\",\n                \"email\": \"yangyuan24@huawei.com\",\n                \"role\": \"maintainer\"\n            }],\n            \"repositories\": [{\n                \"repo\": [\"mindspore/mindarmour\"],\n                \"committers\": [{\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"ZhibinHan\",\n                    \"name\": \"hanzhibin\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Huawei\",\n                    \"email\": \"hanzhibin1@huawei.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"limingjun1\",\n                    \"name\": \"Mr. Li\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Zhejiang University of Technology\",\n                    \"email\": \"NA\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"hu2175\",\n                    \"name\": \"Rice Zhang\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Zhejiang University\",\n                    \"email\": \"8623924@qq.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"qmckw\",\n                    \"name\": \"Kewei\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Huazhong University of Science and Technology\",\n                    \"email\": \"2512235663@qq.com\",\n                    \"role\": \"committer\"\n                }, {\n                    \"gitee_id\": \"Mr_GerhardtHu_Fox\",\n                    \"name\": \"Mr. Hu\",\n                    \"organization\": \"Northeast University\",\n     